# The two creature cards enter the battlefield at the same time (CR 110.2a), so each one's "whenever another creature you
# control enters" sees the other (CR 603.6a). Bot1 names Woodland Changeling first and Aunt May second: had they entered one at a
# time in that order, Aunt May would not have been there to see the Changeling. Aunt May triggers for it: Bot1 gains 1 life, and
# the Changeling (a 2/2), every creature type and so a Spider, gets a +1/+1 counter (1 + 2 = 3, within the 6).

